    "turn_text": "very visual. It's right at eye level, which is interesting. And you talk a lot in your book, Walking with the Wind, on which March is based, about what's called the Spirit of History. Some people might call it fate or divine providence, you call it the spirit of history. It was almost to me, seems like the spirit of history brought you and this young man together to use this modality to reach a new generation.",
