    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86732.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 51,
    "turn_text": "I'm convinced we have never really discussed it in this light, but you reminded me, I'm convinced that it's something in new order to think. Call it fate. but I call it the spirit of history that brought us together at this time in this space to help move us much further down that road to creating the beloved community, a community at peace with itself, not just an American community, but a war community.",
