    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86732.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 54,
    "turn_text": "In one of your books, you say that you have not seen a level of rancor in politics like this, in your lifetime, even surpassing what happened in the 1960s, which was very interesting for me to read, that you feel it's gotten that much worse.",
