      {
        "text": "Fear among undocumented immigrants is an avoidable consequence of current policies, not an inevitable outcome.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a shared national interest in protecting the welfare of all citizens, including marginalized groups.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      },
      {
        "text": "Nonviolent approaches are more legitimate and effective than confrontational methods in achieving social change.",
        "confidence": 0.82
      },
      {
