        "text": "God exists and actively loves individuals, including enemies.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Moral value is derived from divine love, particularly toward adversaries.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Seeing someone as a human being requires transcending adversarial framing.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes the Montgomery Method is relevant to moral or ethical behavior.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Reading old texts like 1950s comics can provide meaningful insights into contemporary ethics.",
        "confidence": 0.83
