    "turn_text": "but I'd never written a book before, for sure. And especially, you know, the congressman was my congressman. Since I was three years old, I grew up hearing these stories, hearing about his bravery and learning about the civil rights movement in Atlanta. And, you know, it's one of those sort of magical connections that you never expect will happen when you're just a kid growing up in a town like that.",
