    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86732.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 91,
    "turn_text": "Well that was the hard part right. Originally we had imagined a single volume. And what we turned in was a 500 plus page script. So it was really a question of what do you cut? And eventually the answer was nothing. Put in as much as you possibly can. Tell as much of the truth as you can. Because the details matter. And people need to understand that this was not a great speech that solved everything. But this was a concentrated effort for many, many years by young people willing to give everything for what they believed in.",
