    "turn_text": "Nate's a tremendous talent. He won the Eisner Award, which is like the Oscars of comics for Best Graphic Album in 2008. He's an LA Times book prize finalist. He's just an extraordinarily talented individual and it's been a real pleasure to collaborate with him because he has such a unique eye and he believes deeply in what we're doing. He is someone who grew up in Alabama and Arkansas so he's from the south and so we three southerners have had the opportunity to collaborate on something that has turned out to be very special.",
