  {
    "episode_id": 86732,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/6/86732.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 148,
    "turn_text": "it. You've been listening to Andrew Iden, a staffer for Representative John Lewis of Georgia, a longtime civil rights leader. Idens the co-author with Lewis of a comic book trilogy about Lewis's life called March. We spoke at the Sun Valley Writers Conference in 2014. For more information, including a link to the interview I did with Representative Lewis, check out the Dialog website. Just go to idhopetv.org and click on Dialog. For Dialog, I'm Marcia Franklin. Thanks for watching. I hope you enjoyed this interview which was recorded at the Sun Valley Writers Conference in 2014. And don't forget to subscribe to this podcast to hear more of the engaging speakers who shared their thoughts on their work and the world with me.",
